vey-dcgen (0.10.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release.
  * Listen sockets are server entries. UDP reuseport workers, Unix
    datagrams, and the issuer can be reloaded in place. The CA config
    section is issuer. Certificate generator metrics use the issuer
    prefix. vey-dcgen-ctl reload-issuer reloads only the issuer.
    vey-dcgen-ctl stops and reloads the daemon.

 -- VEY-OSS Developers <developers@vey.oss>  Sun, 01 Nov 2026 00:33:00 +0800
